      "sentenceRef": "Если я поеду — я буду далеко.",
      "explanation": "'Если' (if) + perfective future tense creates a real condition about the future: 'Если я поеду, я буду далеко' = If I go, I will be far away. This describes something that might actually happen. The result clause often uses 'буду' or another future form. Example: 'Если будет дождь, мы останемся дома' (If it rains, we'll stay home).",
